    "chunk_text": "l\u00e6t \u00feu libban \u00fea \u00fee unlibban wyrcon. \u00deone \u00fee h\u00e6me wi\u00f0 nyten, ne l\u00e6t \u00f0u hine libban. Se \u00fee godum offrie buton Gode anum, slea man hine. Ne geunret \u00f0u el\u00f0eodigne; ge w\u00e6ron el\u00feeodige on Egypta lande. Ne deria\u00fe wudewum ne steopcildum. Gyf ge him deria\u00f0, hi hryma\u00fe to me & ic gehyre heora hream. & ic eow ofslea mid swurde, & eowwer wif beo\u00f0 wudewan, & eowre bearn steopcild. Gyf \u00f0u wed nime \u00e6t \u00f0inum nextan, agyf him his reaf \u00e6r sunnan setlunge. Ne t\u00e6l \u00f0u, ne wirig \u00f0u \u00feines folces ealdor. Ne yld \u00feu mid teo\u00feungum, ne mid frumsceattum: syle me \u00fein forme bearn. Do eal swa of hry\u00f0erum & of sceapum: seofon dagas hit bi\u00f0 mid his meder; syle hit me on \u00f0am \u00de\u00e6t fl\u00e6sc \u00fe\u00e6t wildeor abiton, ne ete ge, ac wurpa\u00fe hit hundum. NE underfo ge lease gewitnesse. Ne filig \u00f0u \u00feam folce \u00fee yfel wille don: ne beforan manegon so\u00fees ne wanda. Ne miltsa \u00f0u \u00feearfan on gemange. Gyf \u00f0u gemete \u00feines feondes oxan o\u00fe\u00fee assan, l\u00e6d hine to him. Gyf \u00f0u geseo his assan licgan under byr\u00f0ene, ne ga \u00f0u \u00feanon, ac hefe hine up mid him. Ne \u00feu ne wanda on \u00feerfan dome. Fleoh leasunga: unscyldigne & rihtwisne ne ofsleah \u00f0u. Ne nim \u00feu lac, \u00fea ablenda\u00fe gleawne & aw",
